cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these reproducibility materials, please cite the manuscript and, once available, the Zenodo version DOI."
title: "Reproducibility package for deep-learning denoising and missing-wedge restoration in cryo-ET (Micron review, Peng_extension)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jiang
    given-names: Linhua
