date-released: "2026-10-03"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >
  Bounded supplementary reproducibility materials for a Micron review article
  on cryo-ET denoising and missing-wedge restoration. Includes scripts, hashes,
  half-set evaluation arrays, and an official cryoCARE demonstration fit for
  the Peng_extension controls. Not a new algorithm or full method benchmark.
keywords:
  - cryo-electron tomography
  - denoising
  - missing wedge
  - reproducibility
